<SCENARIO VER="105">
{CREATECG "文字カウント画像" "グラフィック\システム\文字カウント画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<TXSPN>We entered Megasawa City at 21:30.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
In about 15 more minutes we'd reach Nanamiso, where <STYLE ID="1">Mifuyu-san</STYLE> lived.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\後部座席夜.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
The rear-view mirror showed no one.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Akane</STYLE> was in the passenger seat.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\運転席夜.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\なつみ母.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "L" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"............"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Akane</STYLE> hadn't said a word since then.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
She was probably protesting with her silence against our leaving <STYLE ID="3">Natsumi</STYLE> behind.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Akane</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">... I know what you want to say. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">But―"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"I know. Of course anyone would have doubts about it. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">To be honest, I can't quite </STYLE><STYLE ID="5" RUBY="ふ">accept</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> it... but I don't blame you at all. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">More importantly, how do we convince </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Mifuyu</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">..."</STYLE><PG>
―Only now did I begin to think that not bringing <STYLE ID="3">Natsumi</STYLE> might have been a mistake.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But there was no time to go back now.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
If we missed the promised time...
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Not that they necessarily meant to die together at exactly 22:00.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "3000" "PASS"}
{DELETECG "000,人物1" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{STOPSND "SE2" "2000" "PASS"}
{PLAYSND "SE\車エンジン切る.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{PLAYSND "SE\車ドア開閉.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\七海荘.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="4">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Akane</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">, are you ready for this?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Yeah, I'm fine."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Mifuyu-san</STYLE>'s apartment was 203, on the second floor.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
A very plain, old apartment building.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Mifuyu-san</STYLE> and <STYLE ID="6">Haruka-chan</STYLE> were here.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\歩く響く.ogg" "VOICE" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\七海荘ドア.gal" "WAIT" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\七海荘表札アップ.gal" "WAIT" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{STOPSND "VOICE" "500" "WAIT"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "SE\詫言編　夢から\ノック響く.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{MESON "500"}
I knocked on the door.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
There was no intercom.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The sound of knocking on the thin door echoed along the outside walkway.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\詫言編　夢から\ノック響く.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
But even after knocking twice, there was no response at all.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Akane</STYLE> turned the doorknob.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\屋上ドア.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{STOPSND "VOICE" "1000" "WAIT"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Mifuyu</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">? Are you there?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
We slowly went inside.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The air was chilly.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
They were living in a place like this?<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "escapescape.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\七海荘思い出.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
Just past the entrance there was a single room.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Under a dim night-light, I could see two figures, one large and one small.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\美冬アラサーうつむき.gal" "WAIT" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\美冬アラサー横顔.gal" "WAIT" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Akane</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">...?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Mifuyu</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Akane</STYLE> ran to the larger figure.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\美冬アラサーバストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\なつみ母.gal" "WAIT" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
The two of them embraced under the night-light.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Mifuyu</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, I was worried about you!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Akane</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, you really came...!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It was a moving reunion, but this was no time to get sentimental.<PG>
Tomorrow, we might end up killing two children.
{WAIT "100" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{DELETECG "文字カウント画像" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0"}
<PG>
{}
<EVENT VALUE="MESEND">
